y used for primary buttons and accent\nsurfaces."},"2958":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/effects-11","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/effects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/effects#gradients","content":"--gradient-primary-button is an alias of --gradient-primary\nprovided for forward compatibility — both currently resolve to the\nsame linear-gradient(45deg, #33CFFF 0%, #0E86FE 100%)."},"2959":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","type":"page","content":"Border Radius","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius"},"2960":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-0","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","content":"Corner radius tokens shared by inputs, buttons, cards, and dialogs."},"2961":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-1","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#tokens","content":"Tokens"},"2962":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-2","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#usage-guidance","content":"Usage Guidance"},"2963":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-3","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#combining-with-sizes","content":"Combining With Sizes"},"2964":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-4","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#tokens","content":"Vittal Design exposes six radius steps via CSS custom properties.\nThey are mapped to Tailwind's rounded-* utilities, so you can use\neither form."},"2965":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-5","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#usage-guidance","content":"Token"},"2966":{"id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius-6","page_id":"/docs/design-tokens/radius","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-tokens/radius#usage-guidance","con